eptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"While basic setup like connecting to Wi-Fi can be done by the user, professional installation is recommended to ensure secure mounting and optimal positioning for outdoor conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the warranty period for this Outdoor Smart TV?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Outdoor Smart TV 65\\\" IP55 typically comes with a 1 to 2-year warranty covering manufacturing defects and hardware failures, ensuring reliable use in outdoor settings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this outdoor Smart TV compare to traditional indoor TVs for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike indoor TVs, this model is specifically designed with weatherproofing and higher brightness to withstand sun exposure, rain, and dust, ensuring longevity and excellent visibility outdoors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the TV compatible with common smart apps and streaming services?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports popular smart TV operating systems, allowing access to streaming apps like Netflix, YouTube, and more, delivering a full smart TV experience outdoors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the ideal locations to install this Outdoor Smart TV?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is perfectly suited for installation in luxury villas, poolside areas, rooftop terraces, and yacht decks where weather resistance and high brightness are essential.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the TV support touch or remote control features in outdoor settings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TV operates via remote control and standard smart TV interfaces; touch functionality is limited due to outdoor protective casing but remote and mobile app controls work seamlessly.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pricing context for premium outdoor Smart TVs like this model?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Premium outdoor Smart TVs are generally priced higher than indoor models due to enhanced weatherproofing, brightness, and durability features, providing long-term value for outdoor entertainment.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Outdoor Smart TV 65\\\" IP55\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/outdoor-smart-tv-65\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\