ofessional installation is recommended to ensure secure mounting and optimal positioning for outdoor conditions.</p><h3>What is the warranty period for this Outdoor Smart TV?</h3><p>The Outdoor Smart TV 65&quot; IP55 typically comes with a 1 to 2-year warranty covering manufacturing defects and hardware failures, ensuring reliable use in outdoor settings.</p><h3>How does this outdoor Smart TV compare to traditional indoor TVs for outdoor use?</h3><p>Unlike indoor TVs, this model is specifically designed with weatherproofing and higher brightness to withstand sun exposure, rain, and dust, ensuring longevity and excellent visibility outdoors.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Outdoor Smart TV 65\\\" IP55 | Brightluxx Dubai UAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Durable 65\\\" Outdoor Smart TV IP55 for Dubai businesses. Enhance outdoor entertainment with Brightluxx. Buy in UAE today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/outdoor-smart-tv-65\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/outdoor-smart-tv-65\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\